			"notes": "- Updated the mod to 26.3.\n\n- Players can now retrieve their own head from the Creative inventory.\n\n- The Cracked Decorated Pot is now available in the Creative inventory.\n\n- Added workaround Spawn Eggs for Illusioners, Killer Bunnies, and Giants to the Creative inventory.\n\n- Added a workaround item for the Spawner Minecart to the Creative inventory.\n\n- Added a workaround item for the Lightning Bolt to the Creative inventory.\n\n- Improved performance of the heightmap debug renderer.\n\n- A patch for the security flaw in \"/chase\" is now built in.\n\n- Bug fixes."
		},
